    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363780/extras/3e09306dd15f227c7927aa1a24169a2e.avif?t=1734017141\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>They dug too deep! An army of darkness has been released! Now it's up to the faith and skill of Warren, a gunslinging priest, to close the gates of darkness and SAVE THE MINERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363780/extras/c443e0210e07d6f1d129bd3a294e6463.avif?t=1734017141\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong> - top-down game view, simplified inventory/boost system, level randomization for endless unique maps, leaderboard, &amp; arcade style game play. Imagine Galaga meets Gauntlet set in a western world where you slay evil critters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363780/extras/4f16e8148346577f8d2362a885b0073f.avif?t=1734017141\" width=476 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters will drop monster credits. Grateful miners will trade the supplies you need for 20 monster credits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363780/extras/1620141f018e5395c65cd46b7d02c7c7.avif?t=1734017141\" width=468 height=594 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save as many miners as possible and see how many levels you can compete. This will boost your score and help you climb the leaderboard! <i>NOTE: online play records your score to the leaderboard, but offline play is supported.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363780/extras/3d2f7505ea874fb911b0fbb2605bea16.avif?t=1734017141\" data-has-big width=800 height=518 /></span>Join ACP_Nate's Discord to join in on tournaments. Tournaments are free to join and may include crypto prizes. Tournaments are of course optional, but the community events will make your gaming experience more fun!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363780/extras/3e09306dd15f227c7927aa1a24169a2e.avif?t=1734017141\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>They dug too deep! An army of darkness has been released! Now it's up to the faith and skill of Warren, a gunslinging priest, to close the gates of darkness and SAVE THE MINERS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363780/extras/c443e0210e07d6f1d129bd3a294e6463.avif?t=1734017141\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong> - top-down game view, simplified inventory/boost system, level randomization for endless unique maps, leaderboard, &amp; arcade style game play. Imagine Galaga meets Gauntlet set in a western world where you slay evil critters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363780/extras/4f16e8148346577f8d2362a885b0073f.avif?t=1734017141\" width=476 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters will drop monster credits. Grateful miners will trade the supplies you need for 20 monster credits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363780/extras/1620141f018e5395c65cd46b7d02c7c7.avif?t=1734017141\" width=468 height=594 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save as many miners as possible and see how many levels you can compete. This will boost your score and help you climb the leaderboard! <i>NOTE: online play records your score to the leaderboard, but offline play is supported.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363780/extras/3d2f7505ea874fb911b0fbb2605bea16.avif?t=1734017141\" data-has-big width=800 height=518 /></span>Join ACP_Nate's Discord to join in on tournaments. Tournaments are free to join and may include crypto prizes. Tournaments are of course optional, but the community events will make your gaming experience more fun!</p>",
    "short_description": "They dug too deep! An army of darkness has been released! Now it's up to the faith and skill of Warren, a gunslinging priest, to close the gates of darkness and SAVE THE MINERS! Gameplay - top-down view, simplified inventory system, level randomization, endless maps, leaderboard, &amp; arcade style.",
